<title>USA: Avon Grove SD, Pa., $6.135 mln adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Avon Grove SD, Pa., $6.135 mln adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Avon Grove School District, Pa., said on Mond ay it recalculated PaineWebber Inc's winning bid on the District's $6.135 millio n Series 1997 general obligation bond issue. The District said the true interest cost was 4.598 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 4.566 percent originally calculated.</p>
